{"unit_id":"tag:06L3:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的群胚余纤维范畴（category cofibered in groupoids）。假设存在<MATH_0003>的展示（presentations），分别由极小的（minimal）光滑的（smooth）前可表的（prorepresentable）函子群胚（groupoids in functors）<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>给出。则<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>同构（isomorphic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"群胚余纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"presentations","target_term":"展示"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"前可表的"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"群胚余纤维范畴","context":"被展示的范畴；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"presentations","target_term":"展示","context":"两种展示；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的","context":"展示群胚极小性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"展示群胚光滑性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"前可表的","context":"展示群胚前可表性；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚","context":"给出展示的群胚；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"展示群胚间的同构；术语未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06L3:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>及以下观察得出：态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>与函子群胚（groupoids in functors）的态射（morphism）是同一回事（由定义<REF_0002>中对<MATH_0002>的显式构造）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"商范畴和群胚间的态射；术语未批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子群胚","context":"商范畴态射对应的群胚；术语未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
